    "statement": "$\\|\\cdot\\|_1$ is the trace norm on the difference of the two rank-one projectors"
   }
  ],
  "claim_ref": {
   "content_hash": "sha256:8ea0291b844dbaacaa2fd6f8ae293441343d4441772d71a25e445fd612b40fa2",
